    "status_statement": "open_with_solved_subcases",
    "status_qualification": "The December 2025 Bartsch\u2013Javanpeykar\u2013Levin paper states that neither implication is known in full generality, and March 2026 discussion retains the arithmetic conjecture while separating weak specialness and geometric results.",
