    "status_qualification": "The fixed inhomogeneous large-data continuation target is classified open. HST and Henderson\u2013Snelson provide local or conditional results. Guillen\u2013Silvestre treats spatially homogeneous evolution. Golding\u2013Henderson's August 31, 2026 abstract concerns the Fermi\u2013Dirac modification and explicitly contrasts the classical problem; the full quantum proof was not reviewed. The displayed status is retained from the selected, previously reviewed input, with its bound qualifications; no fresh current-status certification is claimed here.",
