      "statusQualification": "Kahn's2024 final preprint retains Conjecture1 in general, distinguishes the known algebraic-triviality theorem and lists restricted cases. Bounded current discovery found no qualified full-scope positive or negative resolution; the newest discovered BB-related work concerns a different restricted target. This is not exhaustive claim-absence certification. Standing algebraic-closure and restricted-cycle hypotheses are retained, and Section11's diagonal-precomposed vanishing is not mistaken for full external nilpotence. The displayed status is retained from the selected, previously reviewed input, with its bound qualifications; no fresh current-status certification is claimed here.",
