      "evidenceQualified": true,
      "statusReviewedAt": null,
      "statusQualification": "The general conjecture is explicitly open in Tabuada and Diaz; Floccari\u2013Fu's2026introduction still treats it as a conjecture and establishes restricted new K3 cases. Guletskii's claimed Bloch theorem is only a surface-subclass issue for the global Kimura assertion and remains unassessed. No proof audit, exhaustive claim clearance or refereeing inference is asserted. The displayed status is retained from the selected, previously reviewed input, with its bound qualifications; no fresh current-status certification is claimed here.",
      "displayStatus": "open_with_solved_subcases",
