    "exact_target": "For positive integers k_1,...,k_r with k_1>=2, define the classical convergent real multiple zeta value zeta(k_1,...,k_r)=sum_(n_1>...>n_r>0) 1/(n_1^k_1 ... n_r^k_r), of weight k_1+...+k_r. For each k>=2 let Z_k be their Q-linear span at weight k, with Z_0=Q generated by the empty value1 and Z_1={0}. Define d_0=1,d_1=0,d_2=1 and d_k=d_(k-2)+d_(k-3) for k>=3. Is dim_Q Z_k=d_k for every k>=0?",
