    "reader_question": "For a complex projective Q-factorial klt pair with numerically trivial log canonical divisor, do symmetries reduce both its effective nef cone and its effective movable cone to rational polyhedral fundamental domains? In other words, can finite-sided regions describe these divisor cones up to automorphisms and pseudo-automorphisms, respectively?",
