      "statusQualification": "The 25 May 2026 primary introduction states that even a 1.001 approximation NP-hardness result for DkS is unknown. Bounded searches including 2023\u20132026 and July/August/September 2026 found no later resolution; stronger-assumption and restricted-algorithm bounds are not ordinary NP-hardness.",
