      "scopeCorrection": null,
      "whyItMatters": "A proof would establish constant-gap hardness for selecting exactly k vertices, with no stronger complexity assumption in the reduction. It would rule out polynomial-time solutions to this promise problem unless P equals NP.",
      "publicationClarification": null,
