    "exact_target": "For every absolutely almost simple simply connected algebraic group G over a number field K, let A be the finite set of nonarchimedean places v with rank over K_v of G equal to zero, and let delta:G(K)\u2192\u220f_{v\u2208A}G(K_v) be the diagonal map. Every noncentral normal subgroup N of G(K) is delta^\u22121(W) for some open normal subgroup W of that product, with the empty product interpreted as the trivial group.",
