    "exact_target": "For a compact real symplectic manifold (M, omega, tau) with compact nonempty real part L = Fix(tau), and for every Hamiltonian diffeomorphism phi such that L and phi(L) meet transversely, prove that the number of intersection points is at least the total Z/2 Betti number of L.",
