      "evidenceQualified": true,
      "statusReviewedAt": null,
      "statusQualification": "CGP2021and BHPS2025explicitly formulate eventual Coleman-Oort as a conjecture. CGP's sufficient-condition computation and BHPS's two genus4families do not settle it. The BHPS/LTZ25dispute concerns a stronger fixed-genus restricted-type exclusion; its immediate text preserves sufficiently large-genus exclusion for that type. No full-scope proof/disproof was identified within bounded discovery. The displayed status is retained from the selected, previously reviewed input, with its bound qualifications; no fresh current-status certification is claimed here.",
